# FlowSystem

Five stages, each a Markdown file of instructions. Read the one that applies and follow it.

| Stage | Read this | When |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1. Constitution | `skills/spec-constitution/SKILL.md` | New repo, or conventions are undocumented |
| 2. Spec | `skills/spec-architect/SKILL.md` | An idea to specify, or a feature to add |
| 3. Tasks | `skills/spec-tasks/SKILL.md` | A spec exists and work is about to start |
| 4. Implement | `skills/spec-implement/SKILL.md` | A task list exists with unchecked tasks |
| 5. Drift | `skills/spec-drift/SKILL.md` | After a milestone, or on returning to a project |

This file holds no rules of its own. Every rule lives in `skills/`, so the two can never disagree.
